      "title": "HEIMKVAMA v1.0 is out now !",
      "summary": "HEIMKVAMA is a story-driven 2D pixel-art game set in the Viking Age. To pay off his debt, Ketil joins a raid and promises his son he will come home. Across seven chapters, raid villages, fight with axe and shield, ride through hostile lands, sneak into a castle and escape your pursuers. Every step takes him further from home. Will he keep his promise? Languages: Uzbek, English, Russian. Developer: Kinglant Games.",
